OL,3,GNEWSAMotorists urged to slow down for
OL,4,Ared squirrels
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal shelter has issued a plea to
OL,7,Fdrivers to slow down in woodland areas
OL,8,Fafter seven red squirrels were injured
OL,9,Fon an island's roads in one day.
OL,11,FThe JSPCA Animals' Shelter, in St
OL,12,FHelier, Jersey, said that it had been
OL,13,Fcalled to a worrying number of
OL,14,Fcasualties in "a short space of time".
OL,16,FJersey has a thriving red squirrel
OL,17,Fpopulation, due to the absence of grey
OL,18,Fsquirrels, which carry a virus deadly
OL,19,Fto their red cousins.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
